      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:49:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's New in 1.3.4</h2><ul><li><b>Fix:</b> Connecting to company VPN from home no longer triggers a false office check-in.</li><li><b>Settings:</b> Network Detection now shows a "VPN Active" indicator when office detection is suppressed.</li></ul>
      ]]></description>
